      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, begin by selecting a filter and then applying it."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the process initiation and splits the opening sentence into its constituent structural and action steps. Re-typing and splitting preserve behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After applying the filter, click on the Submit button."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the explicit instruction to click the Submit button."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, check if the option to submit is set to \"false\"."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the conditional check as an action node feeding into an XOR branch. Behaviour-preserving re-typing."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, then apply another filter."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly models the 'false' branch path and the subsequent action. Variable abstraction (v1=false) aligns with the source condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the option to submit is set to \"true\", then continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the complementary 'true' branch and the rejoins the flow. Structural plumbing preserves behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Additionally, check if there is another filter to apply."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the second conditional check and its XOR split correctly."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is, continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the positive branch of the second check. Both branches in the source simply continue, so mapping to the same target node is behaviourally equivalent."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the negative branch of the second check. Preserves the unconditional continuation described in the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8",
        "guard:b3->n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, if the option to submit is set to \"true\", continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the final conditional verification and branching. Re-typing the condition as an action + branch/guards maintains the original decision logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The process ends when all steps have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Explicitly marks the termination point of the process as stated in the source."
    }
